    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d293-a8">

                <pb facs="0492" n="396" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg396"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Third indorsement.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Headquarters Military Division of Missouri</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Chicago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1872-01-25"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 25, 1872</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>It has been the practice of the Indians on the Mexican side of the Rio Grande to
                        <pb facs="0493" n="397" xml:id="pg397"/> depredate in Texas for many years.
                    As no harm has ever come to any of them for doing so, either from the Mexican
                    government or our own, it is liable to continue.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>P. H. SHERIDAN,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Lieutenant-General
                            Commanding.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <opener>
                        <dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Adjutant-General’s Office</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                                calendar="gregorian" when="1872-02-01"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                    >February</hi> 1, 1872</date>.</dateline>
                    </opener>
                    <p>Official copies:</p>
                    <closer>
                        <signed>E. D. TOWNSEND,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Adjutant-General</hi></signed>
                    </closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
